Subject: Select original camera scrolled overlay with explicit native camera input
Upstream-base: dc238202b310059d80791d0140dee37f27b9a3bf

Retain the original position-generated overlay coordinates, four-stage TEV,
lighting, shadows and diffuse-wrap mutation order. Supply an explicit active
camera position without selecting or replacing the original camera manager.
Use bounded float arrays, typed FIFO calls, checked finite texture matrices and
registry teardown. Console camera, vertex formats and FIFO access remain intact.

